{"unit_id":"z1223473749__dsh-QiuYaTools#card-zh","repo":"z1223473749/dsh-QiuYaTools","commit":"7ba03bfa26298dc7356bd862248ec8ebe8fd9893","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"QiuYa 增强工具箱是 DeepSeek Harness 的 Web 插件，提供电脑操控、会话管理、Git 工作流和界面增强。它通过宿主连接注册电脑操控、工作台、批注、会话窗口、Git、提示词建议与主题功能。用户可在聊天中授权电脑操作并预览接管，管理会话和批注，查看 Git 改动并处理分支或 PR，也可使用附件增强和动态主题。适合希望在 Harness 中集中扩展桌面操作与日常工作流的用户；安装为插件后按需配置功能，无需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:131","src/client/index.tsx:1"]}
{"unit_id":"z1223473749__dsh-QiuYaTools#card-en","repo":"z1223473749/dsh-QiuYaTools","commit":"7ba03bfa26298dc7356bd862248ec8ebe8fd9893","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"QiuYa Tools is a web plugin for DeepSeek Harness. It adds approved computer control with preview and takeover, session windows and bulk archiving, Git workflows, prompt suggestions, attachment enhancements, and themes. Features are enabled in settings; no extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:131","src/client/index.tsx:1"]}
